<title>USA: Pleasanton USD, Calif., $8.685 won by BankAmerica.</title>
<headline>Pleasanton USD, Calif., $8.685 won by BankAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica Securities Inc. said it won $8.685 million of Pleasanton USD, Calif., general obligation bonds, 1997 election Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.54 percent.</p>
</text>
